sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Cached document lookup
    accDescr: A client asks a service for a document. The service checks its cache and fetches from storage only on a cache miss.
    actor Client
    participant Service
    participant Cache
    participant Store
    Client->>Service: Get document
    Service->>Cache: Look up document
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>Service: Cached document
    else Cache miss
        Cache-->>Service: Not found
        Service->>Store: Read document
        Store-->>Service: Document
    end
    Service-->>Client: Document
